  kind: 1
  title: Fried Squash and Onions
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Fried Squash and Onions


    Winter
    squash, sliced

    An onion, sliced

    Salt


    Fry till soft and brown
    at the edges. Feeds two.'
  marginNote: Squash keeps all winter. This makes it taste like fall.
